<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Recovery Link Expired</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;">
        <h2 style="color: #dc3545; margin-top: 0;">Recovery Link Expired</h2>
        
        <p>Hi there,</p>
        
        <p>The account recovery link you tried to use has expired or is no longer valid.</p>
        
        <p>For security reasons, recovery links expire after a set period of time.</p>
        
        <p><strong>What to do next:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Return to the login page</li>
            <li>Click "Forgot password?" or "Recover account"</li>
            <li>Enter your email address to receive a new recovery link</li>
            <li>Use the new link within the time limit to reset your password</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>If you continue to experience issues, please contact our support team.</p>
        
        <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6; margin: 20px 0;">
        
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d;">
            If you didn't request this account recovery, please secure your account immediately and contact support.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>